      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that A sounds more \"corporate\" but both candidates are actually reporting the exact same accomplishments—managing huge budgets and hitting targets. \n\ndo u think the difference in how they talk actually correlates to how smart or capable they are at their jobs? like, is there a risk that we're just assuming B is less competent because of their dialect/grammar even if their results are the same?",
